From: cx2-ag <cx2-ag@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 06:00:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Preserve syscall contracts during regeneration

---
 ndless-sdk/include/syscall-decls.h        |  2 +-
 ndless-sdk/include/syscall-list.h         |  8 +--
 ndless-sdk/libsyscalls/mkStubs.php        |  6 +-
 ndless-sdk/libsyscalls/stubs.cpp          |  8 +--
 ndless-sdk/libsyscalls/test_generator.php | 85 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 95 insertions(+), 14 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 ndless-sdk/libsyscalls/test_generator.php

diff --git a/ndless-sdk/include/syscall-decls.h b/ndless-sdk/include/syscall-decls.h
index a952091..afee68a 100644
